    prov:wasGeneratedBy sub:extraction .

  sub:quote a prov:Entity ;
    schema:text "Hence we see that modifications of structure, viewed by systematists as of high value, may be wholly due to unknown laws of correlated growth, and without being, as far as we can see, of the slightest service to the species." ;
